{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "L'histoire de sa vie", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Bonne chance !", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "Beginner", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la retraite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "l'\u00e9tat d'une personne qui a fini sa vie professionnelle", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : On prend sa retraite apr\u00e8s l'\u00e2ge de 60 ans.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots qu'on entend \u00e0 une f\u00eate de d\u00e9part \u00e0 la retraite.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le mod\u00e8le", "type": "name"}, {"content": "la personne ou la chose qui sert de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Elle est un mod\u00e8le pour ses enfants et ses coll\u00e8gues.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le gestionnaire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le g\u00e9rant ; la personne charg\u00e9e d'une gestion", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Elle est le gestionnaire des affaires de sa famille.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "\u00e9nergique", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui a de l'\u00e9nergie, de l'allant ou de la force", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ce gar\u00e7on n'est jamais fatigu\u00e9 ; il est tr\u00e8s \u00e9nergique. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "assidu, assidue", "type": "name"}, {"content": "travailleur ; laborieux ; bosseur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Cette \u00e9l\u00e8ve travaille beaucoup ; elle est assidue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "excellent, excellente", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tr\u00e8s bon&nbsp;;&nbsp;sup\u00e9rieur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : C'est une excellente nouvelle !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Poser des questions sur la profession des gens au pass\u00e9", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pour poser des questions sur la profession et les aptitudes professionnelles des gens, on peut employer le pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9 du verbe <span class=\"strong\">\u00eatre</span>. <br /> On peut r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 ces questions de fa\u00e7on affirmative ou n\u00e9gative en employant <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"product-color-text\">des adjectifs qualificatifs</span></span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">R\u00e9ponse</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Est-ce qu'il a \u00e9t\u00e9 un bon directeur ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Oui, il a \u00e9t\u00e9 <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">exigeant</span> mais <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">\u00e9quitable</span>. <br /> Non, il n'a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">agr\u00e9able</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative</span></br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">N\u00e9gative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Quel type de directeur a-t-il \u00e9t\u00e9 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Il a \u00e9t\u00e9 un directeur <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">\u00e9nergique</span> et <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">assidu</span>.<br />Il n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 un <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">tr\u00e8s bon</span> directeur.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative</span></br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">N\u00e9gative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Comment a \u00e9t\u00e9 le directeur ce jour-l\u00e0 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Il a \u00e9t\u00e9 <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">heureux</span> d'aider les nouveaux \u00e9tudiants . <br />Le directeur n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 un mod\u00e8le pour les autres.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative</span></br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">N\u00e9gative</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant utilise une information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire et pr\u00e9cise dans des situations simples.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend l'information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire des textes en fran\u00e7ais, qui correspond au sujet communicatif de ce niveau.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend l'information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire des textes e